    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stranded on the Moon. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earth is calling. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you make the long fall home? </strong><br>Only the top 5% of players can finish the storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>The Long Fall Home</strong>, you\u2019ll leap, boost, and puzzle your way through stunning, low-gravity environments in a gravity-defying platformer like no other. From the desolate silence of the Moon to the orbiting debris fields surrounding Earth, every jump counts in this emotional single-player journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the fun doesn\u2019t stop alone. <br>Gather up to <strong>6 players</strong> online for <strong>chaotic multiplayer races and minigames</strong>!<br>Battle gravity and each other across zany competitive maps where pushing your friends off of platforms is part of the fun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf15 <strong>Precision Platforming</strong>: Master physics-based movement through challenging space environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Checkpoints: </strong>Don't fall all the way back to the moon when you miss a platform. Instead respawn at your nearest checkpoint, allowing you to push through the storyline easier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5<strong>Unlock &quot;Hard Mode&quot; after completing the story on &quot;Easy Mode&quot;</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udef0\ufe0f <strong>Cinematic Story Mode</strong>: A mysterious and emotional solo journey from the Moon back to Earth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong>: Race, shove, and sabotage up to 6 players in hilarious online competitions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Replayable Maps</strong>: Compete for the fastest time or the funniest fall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Gamepad Supported</strong>: Designed with tight controls for both keyboard and controller players.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stranded on the Moon. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earth is calling. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you make the long fall home? </strong><br>Only the top 5% of players can finish the storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>The Long Fall Home</strong>, you\u2019ll leap, boost, and puzzle your way through stunning, low-gravity environments in a gravity-defying platformer like no other. From the desolate silence of the Moon to the orbiting debris fields surrounding Earth, every jump counts in this emotional single-player journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the fun doesn\u2019t stop alone. <br>Gather up to <strong>6 players</strong> online for <strong>chaotic multiplayer races and minigames</strong>!<br>Battle gravity and each other across zany competitive maps where pushing your friends off of platforms is part of the fun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf15 <strong>Precision Platforming</strong>: Master physics-based movement through challenging space environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Checkpoints: </strong>Don't fall all the way back to the moon when you miss a platform. Instead respawn at your nearest checkpoint, allowing you to push through the storyline easier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5<strong>Unlock &quot;Hard Mode&quot; after completing the story on &quot;Easy Mode&quot;</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udef0\ufe0f <strong>Cinematic Story Mode</strong>: A mysterious and emotional solo journey from the Moon back to Earth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong>: Race, shove, and sabotage up to 6 players in hilarious online competitions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Replayable Maps</strong>: Compete for the fastest time or the funniest fall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Gamepad Supported</strong>: Designed with tight controls for both keyboard and controller players.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The Long Fall Home is a mind-bending precision puzzle-platformer set in space. Traverse low-gravity puzzles solo in a gripping single-player story mode, or race and sabotage up to 6 friends in the chaotic online multiplayer!",
